{"path":"ranges/zip_transform_view/iterator/operator*","title":"std::ranges::zip_transform_view<F,Views...>::iterator<Const>::operator*","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ranges::zip_transform_view&lt;F,Views...&gt;::<i>iterator</i>&lt;Const&gt;::</span>operator*","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/zip_transform_view/iterator/operator*","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the transformed element obtained by application of the invocable object of type F to the underlying poined-to elements.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> decltype<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* see description */</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the transformed element obtained by application of the invocable object of type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">F</span></code> to the underlying poined-to elements.\n</p><p>Equivalent to\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">return</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/apply\"><span class=\"kw1111\">std::<span class=\"me2\">apply</span></span></a>\n    <span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>... <span class=\"me1\">iters</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> decltype<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/invoke\"><span class=\"kw1065\">std::<span class=\"me2\">invoke</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>parent_<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>fun_, <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>iters...<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n        inner_.<span class=\"me1\">current_</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<p>where <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>parent_<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>fun_</span></code> is the transformation function stored in the parent <span class=\"t-lc\">ranges::zip_transform_view</span>, and <code><i>current_</i></code> is the underlying tuple of iterators into <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Views...</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The element which is the result of transformation (mapping).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-full\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/noexcept_spec\"><code>noexcept</code></a> specification:&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-box\"><span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/invoke\"><span class=\"kw1065\">std::<span class=\"me2\">invoke</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>parent_<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>fun_, <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>INTS<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>inner_.<span class=\"me1\">current_</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>...<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></span></div></div>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd> where <code><i>INTS</i></code> is the pack of integers <code>0, 1, ..., (sizeof...(Views)-1)</code>.\n</dd></dl>\n</dd></dl>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is not provided.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if the <code><i>parent_</i></code> pointer to parent <span class=\"t-lc\">ranges::zip_transform_view</span> is null (e.g. if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is default constructed).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/zip_transform_view","title":"std::ranges::views::zip_transform, std::ranges::zip_transform_view"},{"path":"ranges/zip_transform_view/iterator","title":"std::ranges::zip_transform_view<F,Views...>::iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::zip_transform_view<F,Views...>::iterator<Const>::operator*","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Returns the transformed element obtained by application of the invocable object of type F to the underlying poined-to…"},{"label":"Parameter